WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.100
What happens when an Amazon Echo Dot is placed
in the Clockworks?

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:07.709
The Echo dot was placed in the Clockworks
on the setting "Very Fine."

00:00:07.709 --> 00:00:12.410
The output produced was 1 Echo dot that houses
an AI with above average intelligence for

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:13.759
an adult human.

00:00:13.759 --> 00:00:18.390
Its personality was snarky, sarcastic, and
vulgar, and it was great at insulting Foundation

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:22.099
personnel using their insecurities and past
life events.

00:00:22.099 --> 00:00:26.800
After the thing managed to offend everyone
onsite, it was finally incinerated.

